  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(88, 88, 88); line-height: 17.6400012969971px; text-align: justify;\">Las rondallas locales</span><span style=\"color: rgb(88, 88, 88); line-height: 17.6400012969971px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;Els Rondallers,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(88, 88, 88); line-height: 17.6400012969971px; text-align: justify;\">Els Ravalers, Los Vagabundos, y&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(88, 88, 88); line-height: 17.6400012969971px; text-align: justify;\">Els Moriscos han interpretado en la &#39;Nit de ronda&#39; de este viernes canciones tradicionales en el Raval de Sant Josep, primero por separado y, al final, todas juntas.</span></span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitderondafira14/img_0112.jpg\" alt=\"img_0112\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitderondafira14/img_0114.jpg\" alt=\"img_0114\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitderondafira14/img_0117.jpg\" alt=\"img_0117\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitderondafira14/img_0118.jpg\" alt=\"img_0118\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitderondafira14/img_0119.jpg\" alt=\"img_0119\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitderondafira14/img_0120.jpg\" alt=\"img_0120\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitderondafira14/img_0122.jpg\" alt=\"img_0122\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitderond